# Projects + assets in NO image's build graph. All three Dockerfiles (Faolan/, Faolan.Web/, Faolan.Web.Content/)
# take the repo ROOT as their context, so one ignore file serves them all and it has to be the union of what none
# of them needs. Keeps the context small (Captures alone is hundreds of MB of pcaps/JSON). faolan.sql + its counter
# sidecars at the repo root are NOT matched here - the server image ships the SEED and builds its database from it.
Faolan.Tests
Faolan.Importer
Faolan.ClientLauncher
Faolan.Wireshark
Captures
Archive
docs
tools
**/*.pcapng
**/*.tshark.json
**/*.md
logs.txt

# Local runtime state, some of it created IN the repo root by compose's own bind mounts (./data, ./cdn-store) or by
# a dev run (faolan.db + its WAL sidecars, the log). Never build input - and cdn-store is many GB after a full
# patcher run, so shipping it as build context would dwarf the image.
data
cdn-store
mirror-store
faolan.db
faolan.db-shm
faolan.db-wal
faolan.log
**/.idea
